# Program IDLs the Codama clients are generated from. Collapsed in GitHub
# pull-request diffs and left out of language stats; they stay in the tree
# because `pnpm generate` reads them and their diff is what to review on a
# program bump. source.json (the pinned commit) stays visible.
packages/*/idl/*.json linguist-generated=true
packages/*/idl/source.json -linguist-generated
